This product includes software developed at ThakiCloud.

This repository contains runtime code only. It does not contain or redistribute model weights or evaluation data.
At run time it downloads the published checkpoint ThakiCloud/eg2-hybrid-w4-media from Hugging Face
(Apache-2.0), a 4-bit derivative of google/embeddinggemma-2 (Apache-2.0), and uses that checkpoint's
own eg2_quant.py unchanged.

The vllm/ directory contains a plugin (eg2q) for vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm, Apache-2.0).
vLLM is installed from its upstream release wheels and is not modified or redistributed here.
